<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Baxter as outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Lehman Brothers analyst Amy McDonald said she initiated coverage of Baxter International with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- estimated earnings of $2.06 in 1996, $2.35 in 1997, and $2.73 in 1998.</p>
<p>-- set 12-month price target of $53. Shares rose 5/8 to 45-1/8.</p>
</text>
